WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.144 --> 00:00:03.649
The real Mac app, using its synthetic Marigold Tips project.

2
00:00:03.649 --> 00:00:08.888
The latest check failed. Earlier save points keep their own verdicts.

3
00:00:08.888 --> 00:00:12.893
Choose the last version that passed its check.

4
00:00:12.893 --> 00:00:23.012
Review what comes back, and what does not: secrets, databases and deployments.

5
00:00:23.012 --> 00:00:28.013
Time Machine saves the current version, then creates a separate recovery copy.

6
00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:34.023
The copy is ready on a new local branch. The original folder stays unchanged.

7
00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:39.039
Database contents, secret values and deployed changes do not come back.
